data: {"id": "06d4fe4be2e64443-thinking-parallel_evidence-1176", "run_id": "06d4fe4be2e64443", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 采集事实\n\n| 维度 | 关键事实 |\n|------|----------|\n| **Kubernetes 状态** | Pod `aiops-case-v14/workload` 处于 `Pending`，容器状态为 `ContainerCreating`，无 Pod IP，重启 0 次。 |\n| **Events (直接原因)** | Kubelet 报错：`FailedCreatePodSandBox`。根本错误：`failed to find plugin \"aiops-unavailable\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]`。 |\n| **Pod Spec** | 引用了 Multus CNI 网络注解 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: secondary-net`。 |\n| **Metrics** | Prometheus 确认 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 为 `ContainerCreating`，`kube_pod_status_pha", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789373741760, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

