ltus 的 `secondary-net` 网络，但在调度节点（Node 2）的 `/opt/cni/bin` 路径中，缺失名为 `aiops-unavailable` 的 CNI 插件二进制文件。这导致 kubelet 在创建 Pod 沙箱（sandbox）并尝试添加容器到网络时，无法找到对应插件，直接抛出 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，使 Pod 陷入 `ContainerCreating` 状态（见证据 1, 2, 3）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 30.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 36.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v14/workload: 36.3s (Evidence 27.8s, RCA 8.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v14/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 77.399, "metrics": {"run_id": "06d4fe4be2e64443", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 77.40507984161377, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confid